      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最終大会のあとの、よく晴れた朝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "テラスの一番日当たりのいい席で、ミナトが大きな地図を広げていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "minato.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "旅の地図だ。四十七の戦場に、几帳面な印。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "でも私は知ってる。この地図の行き先欄は、ずっと空欄だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "行き先は、いつも依頼人が決めてきたから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "次の目的地、決まったんですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vz3er0",
      "speakerName": "ミナト",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "いや。目的地より先に、書くものがあると気づいた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼は赤鉛筆で、地図に最初の丸をつけた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "魔王城でも、伝説の霊峰でもない。——この闘技場に。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それから丸の横に、小さな字で書き添えた。「出発地点」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vz3er0",
      "speakerName": "ミナト",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "今までの旅は、全部「目的地」から始まった。今度の旅は、帰る場所から始めてみようと思う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……いい旅の始め方です。窓口として、太鼓判を押します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朝の風が地図をめくろうとして、彼は花柄の短剣を、そっと重しに置いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "神器の代わりに残った一本の、新しい仕事だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vz3er0",
      "speakerName": "ミナト",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それと、掲示板に出してきた。柿落とし興行の、出演届。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "演目「刃のない剣舞・四十七の物語」備考「上演後の昼食は、誰も救わずに選びます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その下に、食堂の職人さんたちの応援署名が、もう十七人ぶん並んでいた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vz3er0",
      "speakerName": "ミナト",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ミミさん。今日の日替わり、AとBどっちにするか——三十秒で決めた。付き合ってくれるか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三十秒。自己新記録だ。私は「休憩中」の札を取りに走った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "出発地点の朝ごはんは、二人で食べると決まってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.line.012c",
      "lineId": "minato.epilogue.line.012c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳の奥が、あったかくなった。誰が決めたかって、今、私が決めた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "minato.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
